ng Article. This was rejected; the Article was adopted as it stood.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0660.18","speaker_id":"hagerup","certain":true,"name":"Francis Hagerup","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.abstentions-on-revision","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[660]}]},{"seg_id":"s0660.19","meeting":31,"doc":"minutes","pdf":660,"printed":650,"texts":{"fr":"Article 59.","en":"Article 59.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.abstentions-on-revision","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[660]}]},{"seg_id":"s0660.20","meeting":31,"doc":"minutes","pdf":660,"printed":650,"texts":{"fr":"La question de la durée du délai est soulevée par M. HAGERUP. Toutefois les dispositions du texte ne sont pas modifiées.","en":"The question of the time limit was raised by M. HAGERUP, but no amendment was made.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0660.20","speaker_id":null,"certain":false,"name":null,"role":null},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.abstentions-on-revision","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[660]}]},{"seg_id":"s0660.21","meeting":31,"doc":"minutes","pdf":660,"printed":650,"texts":{"fr":"MM. RICCI-BUSATTI et HAGERUP s'abstiennent de voter sur l'alinéa 3 de l'article, et demandent que leur abstention soit constatée au procès-verbal.","en":"M. RICCI-BUSATTI and M. HAGERUP abstained from voting upon Paragraph 3 of the Article and requested that this fact might be recorded in the Procès-verbal.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0660.21","speaker_id":"ricci-busatti","certain":true,"name":"Arturo Ricci-Busatti","role":"member"},"sources":["Edition","Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.abstentions-on-revision","weight":1.0,"end":79,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":5044,"start":29},{"concept":"c.abstentions-on-revision","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[660]}]},{"seg_id":"s0660.22","meeting":31,"doc":"minutes","pdf":660,"p